    "- Slope downsloping mengindikasikan iskemia yang lebih parah\n",
    "\n",
    "**l. CA (Number of Major Vessels Colored by Fluoroscopy)**\n",
    "\n",
    "Nilai valid: 0-3\n",
    "- Mayoritas pasien memiliki ca=0 (tidak ada pembuluh tersumbat)\n",
