      "Fitur           Q1         Q3         IQR        Bawah      Atas       Outliers  \n",
      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "age             48.00      61.00      13.00      28.50      80.50      0         \n",
      "sex             0.00       1.00       1.00       -1.50      2.50       0         \n",
