      "  • Estimators: [100, 200, 300] (3 nilai)\n",
      "  • Random State: [42] (1 nilai)\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Parameter Feature Selection:\n",
      "  • PCC Threshold: [0.12, 0.15, 0.25] (3 nilai)\n",
      "  • Chi2 K: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7] (7 nilai)\n",
      "\n",
      "📈 TOTAL KOMBINASI:\n",
      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "  1. Baseline:    3 kombinasi\n",
