      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "\n",
      "Scenario  N_Config     Mean      Std      Min      Max   Median\n",
      "Baseline         3 0.842404 0.003367 0.838265 0.846514 0.842432\n",
      "     PCC         9 0.843660 0.005172 0.838095 0.854762 0.842347\n",
      "    Chi2        21 0.818213 0.032143 0.738690 0.842517 0.833844\n",
      "Combined        63 0.800030 0.046394 0.680527 0.858844 0.809099\n",
      "\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "🧪 FRIEDMAN TEST\n",
